1
00:00:00,100 --> 00:00:03,859
Put two grapes in a microwave, and they spit out a ball of plasma.

2
00:00:04,299 --> 00:00:08,801
Why? Physicists want to squeeze light into tiny spots, and grapes do it.

3
00:00:09,199 --> 00:00:11,419
A microwave is about 5 inches long.

4
00:00:11,820 --> 00:00:15,560
But inside water, it shrinks to about half an inch: grape size.

5
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:19,300
So each grape traps the waves, and they bounce around inside.

6
00:00:19,797 --> 00:00:24,079
Where two grapes touch, it all piles into one spot the size of a pinhead.

7
00:00:24,478 --> 00:00:28,379
That rips electrons off the salt in the juice. Boom, plasma.

8
00:00:29,039 --> 00:00:32,100
They proved it with water beads: no skin, same fireball.

9
00:00:32,600 --> 00:00:33,899
So never do this at home:
